{% comment %}
  Local override of al_folio_core's footer.liquid.

  The theme's footer renders a copyright line plus the "Powered by Jekyll /
  al-folio / GitHub Pages" credits. This override renders nothing, which removes
  the footer bar from every page. `site.footer_text` in _config.yml is unused
  while this file exists.

  To restore the default footer, delete this file.
{% endcomment %}
